A lending wait that takes any Thread capability, without the right to lend.
A thread lends its time through a capability that does not allow it.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a thread came to lend its time but by its own wait, through a capability with the right to lend

